      "context_excerpt": "The clearest proof is in MotionBricks : a real-time motion model — trained on more than 350,000 motion clips, running at game-engine speeds — that lets creators direct and connect character movements. The same model that drives the animated character on screen drives a Unitree G1 humanoid robot in the room, using computer graphics and simulation to accelerate physical AI development.",
